    "text": "A thin circular disk is in the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math> plane as shown in the figure. The ratio of its moment of inertia about&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>&nbsp;axes will be:<br /><img src=\"assets\\qt0203_de9c915bcd5c.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 184px;\" />"
  },
